[{"title":"郎文炳心远斋","author":"李俊民","text":"窃笑滥巾北岳，那能补衲中条。\n自有胸中丘壑，不妨稳向市朝。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1498,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"伯德仲植张长史帖","author":"李俊民","text":"莫就严陵买菜，无劳逸少换鹅。\n但得云烟一纸，那在邺侯书多。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1499,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"戏沂公巨川","author":"李俊民","text":"八仙诗里苏晋，三笑图中远公。\n选甚逃禅破戒，我师自有家风。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1500,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"戏武夫韩公 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"论功终是猎犬，见事不如擒虎。\n我愿一识荆州，人道莫逢玉汝。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1501,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"戏武夫韩公 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"结柳未送穷车，弊衣先入歌院。\n虽得萧何指踪，难与老子同传。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1502,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"老杜醉归图 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"寻常行处酒债，每日江头醉归。\n薄暮斜风细雨，长安一片花飞。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1503,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"老杜醉归图 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"百钱街头酒价，蹇驴醉里风光。\n莫傍郑公门去，恐犹恨在登床。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1504,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"史遂良酒债 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"都因焚券家贫，亲与当炉人卖。\n问得街头酒价，索取江头酒债。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1505,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"史遂良酒债 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"酒诰一篇既出，离骚亦可不作。\n愧我家无阿堵，笑他人饮狂药。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1506,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"史遂良酒债 其三","author":"李俊民","text":"涤器不辞亲酌，过门无柰客恶。\n未尝解下金龟，必能画得黄鹤。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1507,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"史遂良酒债 其四","author":"李俊民","text":"从来欢伯气和，何故督邮味恶。\n陶令无钱但赊，潘子著水不错。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1508,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"窦子温江山图","author":"李俊民","text":"醉里扁舟烟浪，望中几屐云山。\n长天秋水一色，明月清风两閒。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1509,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"猫犬图","author":"李俊民","text":"狡兔空有三穴，首鼠漫持两端。\n我辈天生健武，从渠股慄心寒。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1510,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"北窗高卧图","author":"李俊民","text":"问字不得兀兀，借书不得陶陶。\n谁遣人来送酒，枕边正读离骚。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1511,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"雪谷早行图","author":"李俊民","text":"积素茫茫缟夜，流光耿耿扬辉。\n行人抵死贪路，何处家山未归。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1512,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"史正之器子买得","author":"李俊民","text":"陆郎初见怀橘，阿买颇解识字。\n或恐西河器明，忙为东野收泪。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1513,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"灵照女","author":"李俊民","text":"留下一重公案，有女谁似庞家。\n不试提蓝手段，若为点破丹霞。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1514,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"锦堂四景图 其一 春水满四泽","author":"李俊民","text":"淼淼舒如罗带，鳞鳞皱似縠纹。\n谁道卧龙不起，须臾变化风云。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1515,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"锦堂四景图 其二 夏云多奇峰","author":"李俊民","text":"幸得从龙变态，尚何出岫无心。\n正苦人閒畏日，不思天上为霖。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1516,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"锦堂四景图 其三 秋月扬明辉","author":"李俊民","text":"清光一片如洗，西去姮娥耐秋。\n可惜广寒人老，谁将玉斧再修。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1517,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"锦堂四景图 其四 冬岭秀孤松","author":"李俊民","text":"山前倾盖独奇，雪里盘根岁深。\n千年老鹤相伴，谁似苍髯有心。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1518,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"谒秦吴二王庙 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"颓垣陊殿夕阳中，血食虽同事不同。\n揖让干戈两陈迹，酹觞抛与落花风。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1519,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"谒秦吴二王庙 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"杖藜行处记曾过，草草杯盘野兴多。\n举目山川纵如旧，一场梦抵几南柯。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1520,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"卜居","author":"李俊民","text":"东邻西舍两三家，簌簌墙头落枣花。\n惭愧画梁双燕子，笑人今日又天涯。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1521,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"中秋夜梦","author":"李俊民","text":"征衣不用赠春罗，试听尊前一曲歌。\n为问从来云雨事，如何偏向梦中多。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1522,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"读项羽传","author":"李俊民","text":"鸿沟时暂割山河，楚国山河一半多。\n欲去故乡誇富贵，不知沛有大风歌。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1523,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"糟笋","author":"李俊民","text":"瓮中有地可藏真，子子孙孙曲糵醺。\n谁是圣之清者后，此君应负此君君。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1524,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"新样团茶","author":"李俊民","text":"春风倾倒在灵芽，才到江南百草花。\n未试人閒小团月，异香先入玉川家。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1525,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"重午偶题","author":"李俊民","text":"只为离骚话独清，至今犹恨楚君臣。\n魂招不得归何处，闲气都留与艾人。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1526,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"子猷访戴图","author":"李俊民","text":"雪后山阴本乘兴，似非特为故人来。\n纵能一见戴安道，船未回时心己回。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1527,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂途中即事 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"晚风吹雨过山堂，灯火秋凉好对床。\n却被荒鸡笑人懒，一声催起著鞭忙。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1528,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂途中即事 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"悠悠旌旆出山城，世事惊心几变更。\n水郭烟村谁是伴，老夫矍铄尚堪行。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1529,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和筹堂途中即事 其三","author":"李俊民","text":"斗酒中閒诗百篇，锦囊新句落谁边。\n无穷山水吟难尽，说似画师僧巨然。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1530,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"船子和月图","author":"李俊民","text":"千尺丝纶在手中，月明归去满船空。\n寒江岂是鱼难钓，钓得还将不钓同。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1531,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和河楼闲望 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"去去来来不系舟，至今师渡几时休。\n洗兵岂是天无雨，尽逐黄河入海流。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1532,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和河楼闲望 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"一夜长空落将星，不知谁抱越人冰。\n中原可惜衣冠地，自古以来多废兴。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1533,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"用筹堂韵","author":"李俊民","text":"清尊莫惜再三开，别后何曾得好怀。\n为向绿衣花使道，杖藜不是等闲来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1534,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"答满法师","author":"李俊民","text":"此身分付水云閒，不见高人得句难。\n待学江西立公案，便宜筑个小诗坛。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1535,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和泰禅","author":"李俊民","text":"淡泊生涯分自甘，十年霜叶碎青衫。\n忽从问道山前过，牧马之儿是指南。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1536,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"橙数珠 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"典刑酿出洞庭霜，只取青圆不待黄。\n凡俗尽从千佛转，忘言老宿但拈香。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1537,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"橙数珠 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"从头细转梵王经，一串秋香得洞庭。\n为报重苏当自惜，莫教落入念珠厅。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1538,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"竹如意 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"曾为弹琴指甲伤，有时曝背竹书光。\n不须爬痒倩仙爪，忍待一朝春笋长。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1539,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"竹如意 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"即时参得指头禅，说似家风玉版传。\n一日佛堂光自放，我师歇在古灵前。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1540,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"雪庵二梅图","author":"李俊民","text":"老对风光百不堪，画图彷佛见江南。\n为君试草花閒赋，未必心肠似雪庵。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1541,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"赠碧落和讲主","author":"李俊民","text":"萧萧古寺掩松关，雨后无人草木闲。\n埽地家风谁举似，我师特特为开山。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1542,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"跋窦子温江山图","author":"李俊民","text":"淼淼澄江欲拍天，参差烟树老江边。\n举头不见长安日，一棹秋风载酒船。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1543,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"济源龙潭","author":"李俊民","text":"尘世悠悠不识真，一潭春碧养潜鳞。\n可怜无故惊雷起，误却山前失箸人。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1544,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"裴公亭","author":"李俊民","text":"青山如画水如蓝，自笑平生性僻耽。\n尊酒留连妨逸兴，不能一到侍中庵。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1545,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"与奉仙观道士元明道","author":"李俊民","text":"野鹤飘飘性自高，徘徊尘世岂难抛。\n栖真旧隐无多地，何处仙山不可巢。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1546,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"富公草堂","author":"李俊民","text":"青山重叠水萦回，山水中閒几往来。\n风物不殊人世改，中州何处是昆台。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1547,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"谢杨成之","author":"李俊民","text":"与客西从济上回，明朝扶杖到云台。\n一尊相送休频劝，留作山行软脚杯。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1548,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"阻风","author":"李俊民","text":"东风作恶几时休，况值春光欲尽头。\n谁谓闲人无个事，一年长是为花愁。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1549,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"答筹堂见招 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"须信人閒足别离，相看能得几多时。\n浮云一片无根蒂，去去来来自不知。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1550,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"答筹堂见招 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"日日相陪鹤发翁，乌纱白葛道家风。\n火云堆向山南去，暑气蒸人似甑中。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1551,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"答筹堂见招 其三","author":"李俊民","text":"俯仰随人亦自欺，精神无复似当时。\n年来世事俱尝遍，只有闲中味不知。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1552,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"答筹堂见招 其四","author":"李俊民","text":"冠世声名盖世功，寻常杯酒坐生风。\n区区问舍求田客，尽在元龙一笑中。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1553,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"答筹堂见招 其五","author":"李俊民","text":"日日言归未得归，白头才是入山时。\n依前却趁逍遥出，惭愧山灵我不知。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1554,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"答筹堂见招 其六","author":"李俊民","text":"谁谓长河不可通，只消送客一帆风。\n故人别后情偏重，犹恐相逢是梦中。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1555,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"史遂良寿日","author":"李俊民","text":"任他白发不相饶，两颊春红醉里潮。\n今日凤凰台上月，未知谁可共吹箫。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1556,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"和王季文襄阳变后","author":"李俊民","text":"将军横槊面潮红，一举淮南埽地空。\n堪笑楚人无伎俩，至今犹说马牛风。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1557,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"张翔卿出家","author":"李俊民","text":"绛帕蒙头读道书，孙郎见后肯容无。\n休将侥倖乖名教，天上臞仙即是儒。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1558,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"鳌背元夜","author":"李俊民","text":"山市家家秉烛游，风檐齐挂月灯毬。\n不须更用闲妆点，人在鳌峰最上头。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1559,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"许司谏醉吟图","author":"李俊民","text":"席地风光引兴来，不辞白发被春催。\n眼前有句贪拈掇，闲却梨花树下杯。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1560,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"明皇击梧图","author":"李俊民","text":"不使梨园弟子知，太平音在凤凰枝。\n一朝野鹿衔花去，长恨秋风落叶时。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1561,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"秋江断雁图","author":"李俊民","text":"不堪愁里见秋光，江北江南木叶黄。\n谁信朔风犹跋扈，天涯吹断弟兄行。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1562,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"游石堂山","author":"李俊民","text":"雨后青山画不如，算心人去有谁居。\n紫云空锁神清洞，不见丹崖四字书。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1563,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"句龙庙","author":"李俊民","text":"溪行十里气如蒸，危槛凭虚不厌登。\n咫尺仙山在尘世，杖藜来往几人曾。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1564,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"阳关图","author":"李俊民","text":"一杯送别古阳关，关外千重万叠山。\n试问青青渭城柳，不知眼见几人还。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1565,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"烟江叠嶂图","author":"李俊民","text":"挥毫落纸生云烟，江北江南水墨天。\n爱画主人胸次别，卧游不用买山钱。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1566,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"千里江山图 其一","author":"李俊民","text":"曾把云山烂漫酬，杖藜随处贾胡留。\n如今脚力那千里，水墨中间只卧浮。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1567,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"千里江山图 其二","author":"李俊民","text":"笔下江山取意成，一峰未尽一峰生。\n凭谁试向行人问，水郭烟村第几程。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1568,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"荅祁定之","author":"李俊民","text":"归袖迎风拂面埃，青山望处白云埋。\n如何千载离家鹤，学得仙时不便来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1569,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"戏赠","author":"李俊民","text":"布袍褴褛化风埃，是处青山骨可埋。\n三笑家风□时了，我师容易去还来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1570,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"雪中寄","author":"李俊民","text":"秋空一洗绝纤埃，著脚街头雪半埋。\n试问希真门下客，衣蓑曾有葛三来。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1571,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"不寐","author":"李俊民","text":"露下中庭鹤睡惊，娟娟缺月照窗明。\n夜深读罢床头易，纸帐梅花梦不成。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1572,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}},{"title":"西山问羊","author":"李俊民","text":"淡泊不禁频皛饭，寻常无以致毡根。\n西山茧耳多于石，肯与书生踏菜园。","collection":"金末元初","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"金末元初.csv","pointer":1573,"sha256":"060690a7e31859907dbbb768048b96288d6bd9ea30711f108a14b8f9a874576e","dynasty":"金末元初"}}]